    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just that the idea of it being a \"temporary inconvenience\" makes it feel almost... manageable. like, if i just didn't make a mess of things or leave anyone to clean up, then i wouldn't actually be a problem. it feels like the most polite way to handle it. do you think people would actually prefer that? just a quiet exit without the drama?",
